  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.7.2: Bug-fix release. Library diagnostics for expected input problems (child CHD without its parent, corrupt/unsupported header or map, unknown version) are tagged with a UserError scope, so the CLI and Tester bug-report sinks no longer file them as application defects while the console/file logs keep the warning. Decompression and full-image hash failures remain reportable. No public API or encoder output changes: 4,223 library tests + 456 encoder tests on each target framework, jb inspectcode 0 findings, CI chdman parity smoke passed. Pure C# - zero native dependencies. Targets net8.0/net9.0/net10.0/net11.0.",
